/2c2657a24f7ab6a55e81611b5b8e5a9b.mp4?t=1675995337\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2290700/extras/da6db161c72e6f5edc70363aba3a01c7.avif?t=1675995337\" /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >3D Low-poly - Immersive Gameplay</h2>The game is developed with 3D low-poly graphics and realistic physics which creates an immersive gameplay, where the player will feel like they are in the game, not just playing it.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2290700/extras/062f3b8c6614c34935b08a4bd915d0e0.poster.avif?t=1675995337\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2290700/extras/062f3b8c6614c34935b08a4bd915d0e0.webm?t=1675995337\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2290700/extras/062f3b8c6614c34935b08a4bd915d0e0.mp4?t=1675995337\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2290700/extras/dadf5565a15385f753d225e63edf2d8e.poster.avif?t=1675995337\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2290700/extras/dadf5565a15385f753d225e63edf2d8e.webm?t=1675995337\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2290700/extras/dadf5565a15385f753d225e63edf2d8e.mp4?t=1675995337\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Snowy Mountain is the ultimate destination for winter sports enthusiasts! Whether you prefer the thrill of snowboarding, the elegance of skiing, the excitement of snowscootering, or the adrenaline-fueled rush of (winter-) sports and games, this 3D physics game has something for everyone. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2290700/extras/0ff973eb311d335ef2b8af93d3af1c8a.poster.avif?t=1675995337\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2290700/extras/0ff973eb311d335ef2b8af93d3af1c8a.webm?t=1675995337\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2290700/extras/0ff973eb311d335ef2b8af93d3af1c8a.mp4?t=1675995337\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Snowy Mountain offers an unique gaming experience that will keep you coming back for more. So why wait? Download Snowy Mountain today and immerse yourself in a stunning virtual world and experience the thrill of navigating through challenging courses and obstacles !",
